<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia beat Russia 11-1 (halftime 4-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Kate Sage (13); Alyson Annan (4,17,54); Katerina</p>
<p>Powell (21,46,60); Linda Harvey (50,57); Jenny Morris (37);</p>
<p>Kelly Free (68).</p>
<p>Russia - Irina Piskunova (70).</p>
</text>
